ed_word":"chat"},{"word":"with","start":142.43231,"end":142.5923,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"with"},{"word":"us","start":142.5923,"end":142.91231,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"us"},{"word":"free","start":142.91231,"end":143.15231,"confidence":0.6855469,"punctuated_word":"free"},{"word":"of","start":143.15231,"end":143.3923,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"of"},{"word":"charge","start":143.3923,"end":143.87231,"confidence":0.99365234,"punctuated_word":"charge."},{"word":"we","start":143.87231,"end":144.1123,"confidence":0.99902344,"punctuated_word":"We"},{"word":"want","start":144.1123,"end":144.35231,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"want"},{"word":"to","start":144.35231,"end":144.51231,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"to"},{"word":"help","start":144.51231,"end":144.6723,"confidence":1.0,"punctuated_word":"help"},{"word":"you","start":144.6723,"end":145.1723,"confidence":0.9980469,"punctuated_word":"you."}],"paragraphs":{"transcript":"\nDaisybill publishes a free claims administrator directory on our website. The directory reflects our clients' payment data from bills they submitted in the prior three hundred and sixty five days. Here, the directory shows nearly 6,000 Daisy bill providers sent bills for more than 518,000 workers' comp injuries. Daisy bill providers sent over 2,600,000 workers' comp bills to claims administrators for these injuries. In workers' comp, a claims administrator, also called a payer or carrier, is responsible for paying workers' comp bills.\n\nThe directory homepage lists the 718 claims administrators to which Daisy bill providers sent their millions of workers' comp bills. Daisy data shows that these claims administrators paid Daisy bill providers bills in an average of eight point nine working days. For each claims administrator, the directory publishes the average number of working days the claims administrator For example, providers sent Sedgwick more than 534,000 workers' comp bills, which Sedgwick paid in an average of seven working days. The directory also publishes the percentage of duplicate bills providers send to each claims administrator. In workers' comp, if the claims administrator reports that the original bill is not on file or fails to respond to the original bill, a provider must submit a duplicate bill for payment.\n\nOf the 2,600,000 workers' comp bills providers sent with Daisy Bill, just 2% were duplicate bills. Daisy Bill's proprietary workers' comp billing technology makes receiving fast, accurate bill payments for treating injured workers easy. Throughout The United States, thousands of providers use Daisy Bill to send millions of workers' comp bills to hundreds of claims administrators. With Daisy Bill technology, providers can confidently treat injured workers, help them return to work, and reclaim their lives. If you have questions, click the pink circle to chat with us free of charge.\n\nWe want to help you.","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"Daisybill publishes a free claims administrator directory on our website.","start":4.3199997,"end":9.22},{"text":"The directory reflects our clients' payment data from bills they submitted in the prior three hundred and sixty five days.","start":9.92,"end":18.075},{"text":"Here, the directory shows nearly 6,000 Daisy bill providers sent bills for more than 518,000 workers' comp injuries.","start":18.935,"end":28.955},{"text":"Daisy bill providers sent over 2,600,000 workers' comp bills to claims administrators for these injuries.","start":29.789999,"end":36.93},{"text":"In workers' comp, a claims administrator, also called a payer or carrier, is responsible for paying workers' comp bills.","start":37.79,"end":45.755}],"num_words":82,"start":4.3199997,"end":45.755},{"sentences":[{"text":"The directory homepage lists the 718 claims administrators to which Daisy bill providers sent their millions of workers' comp bills.","start":46.295002,"end":55.275},{"text":"Daisy data shows that these claims administrators paid Daisy bill providers bills in an average of eight point nine working days.","start":56.010002,"end":63.71},{"text":"For each claims administrator, the directory publishes the average number of working days the claims administrator For example, providers sent Sedgwick more than 534,000 workers' comp bills, which Sedgwick paid in an average of seven working days.","start":64.65,"end":85.005},{"text":"The directory also publishes the percentage of duplicate bills providers send to each claims administrator.","start":85.630005,"end":91.25},{"text":"In workers' comp, if the claims administrator reports that the original bill is not on file or fails to respond to the original bill, a provider must submit a duplicate bill for payment.","start":92.11,"end":104.814995}],"num_words":126,"start":46.295002,"end":104.814995},{"sentences":[{"text":"Of the 2,600,000 workers' comp bills providers sent with Daisy Bill, just 2% were duplicate bills.","start":105.674995,"end":112.655},{"text":"Daisy Bill's proprietary workers' comp billing technology makes receiving fast, accurate bill payments for treating injured workers easy.","start":113.369995,"end":121.46999},{"text":"Throughout The United States, thousands of providers use Daisy Bill to send millions of workers' comp bills to hundreds of claims administrators.","start":122.409996,"end":130.565},{"text":"With Daisy Bill technology, providers can confidently treat injured workers, help them return to work, and reclaim their lives.","start":131.66501,"end":139.045},{"text":"If you have questions, click the pink circle to chat with us free of charge.","start":139.63231,"end":143.87231}],"num_words":90,"start":105.674995,"end":143.87231},{"sentences":[{"text":"We want to help you.","start":143.87231,"end":145.1723}],"num_words":5,"start":143.87231,"end":145.1723}]}}]}]}}